  "releaseNotes": "### 🚀 Major Release v1.4.0\n\nThis release introduces full **Unity Game Engine** support via OpenUPM and adds the high-performance **SfEnumSet** collection.\n\n#### ✨ New Features\n* **Unity Support:** Added `package.json` and `.asmdef` definitions. The library is now fully compatible with Unity 2021.3+ and can be installed via **OpenUPM** or Git URL.\n* **SfEnumSet{T}:** A new zero-allocation set specifically for Enums. Uses bitwise operations instead of hashing.\n    * **Performance:** ~1.7x faster than `HashSet{TEnum}`.\n    * **Memory:** Allocates up to 2x less memory.\n    * Includes new constructor `SfEnumSet(ulong[] buffer)` for easy serialization.\n\n#### ⚡ Performance Optimizations\n* **SfBitArray - SfGrid:** Implemented `Unsafe` address arithmetic for `GetUnchecked` / `SetUnchecked` methods, bypassing JIT bounds checks for maximum speed in tight loops.\n* **SfList:** Reverted enumerator logic to standard array access to enable JIT optimizations (Loop Unrolling - Bounds Check Elimination).\n\n#### 📦 Installation\n\n**For Unity (OpenUPM):**\n```bash\nopenupm add com.kankangames.structforge",
